# Maps the several git identities used by the same person onto one canonical
# name and address, so `git shortlog`, `git blame` and any statistics tool
# attribute their work correctly.
#
# Verify with:  git shortlog -sne --all
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Commit Name <commit@email>

